<#ff8c28>STANCE SWITCH</>
Switch stance (ground, from neutral)		^X
  Akira has two stances, shown by the marker at the bottom of
  the screen (FIST orange, LEG blue). It resets to Fist each
  round. In Fist stance A / B / C are his punches and he has
  Kiko Kai and Urarimon. In Leg stance A / B / C are his kicks
  and he has Hotenshu and Senshubu. The supers follow the
  stance too.

<#ff8c28>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Fist stance: Shin'Iha. Leg stance: Tankyaku. Works in the
  air too (Kurakusho).
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
High Jump		_D_U

<#ff8c28>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
  Punches in Fist stance, kicks in Leg stance.
  Chain A > B > C on hit or block (upward only, ground, crouch
  and air). Any connected normal cancels into specials, EX moves
  and supers.
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Kaihosho (Fist)		_F^C
Tsutenda (Fist)		_DF^C
Kutenshu (Leg)		_F^B

<#ff8c28>SPECIALS</>
  A / B / C picks light / medium / heavy.
Kiko Kai (Fist)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Aerial Kiko Kai (Fist, in the air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Urarimon (Fist)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Hotenshu (Leg)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
Senshubu (Leg)		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff8c28>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
EX Kiko Kai (Fist)		_D_DF_F^C
EX Urarimon (Fist)		_D_DB_B^C
EX Hotenshu (Leg)		_F_D_DF^C
EX Senshubu (Leg)		_D_DB_B^C

<#ff8c28>SUPERS (1 bar)</>
Go Kiko Kai (Fist)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Max Go Kiko Kai (Fist)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Haten Mueishu (Leg)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Max Haten Mueishu (Leg)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff8c28>SUPER (5 bars)</>
Seijo no Tetsui		_F_DF_D_DB_B_F_DF_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
